{
    "name": "戶外活動",
    "data": {
        "phase1": [
            {
                "text": "今天是星期六。主角正在和哥哥聊天，<br>討論明天的行程。來看看他們要去哪裡玩吧！"
            },
            {
                "text": "Bakɨ, niciobi na kusianga, iké kuwa yasu?",
                "textCh": "Bakɨ，明天是星期天，你打算去哪裡？",
                "sound": "text/sound/65814/919649",
                "image": "boy-1.png",
                "background": "1-1.png"
            },
            {
                "text": "nunguresɨ ma knamɨ Aruy na kusianga mua drɨkerle tibila okɨme butulu, musu ka?",
                "textCh": "我明天要和Aruy去溪邊烤肉，你呢？",
                "sound": "text/sound/65814/919650",
                "image": "boy-2.png",
                "background": "1-2.png"
            },
            {
                "text": "biciringi madɨ ka amina margi tamililivanɨ! nuduru ma kɨkɨ nguresɨ mua?",
                "textCh": "聽起來很好玩！我也可以一起去嗎？",
                "sound": "text/sound/65814/919651",
                "image": "boy-1.png",
                "background": "1-1.png"
            },
            {
                "text": "thiurala kububuru ninana!",
                "textCh": "你先問媽媽！（註︰魯凱族稱謂長輩的規範︰都是大家的爺爺、奶奶、爸爸、媽媽稱呼著；因此部落的長輩多或少了，所以部落的長輩都是很重要的人物。）",
                "sound": "text/sound/65814/919652",
                "image": "boy-2.png",
                "background": "1-2.png"
            },
            {
                "text": "navé, nuduruma kɨkɨ nguresɨ kakana sovlé mua drɨkerle tibila?",
                "textCh": "媽媽，我可以跟哥哥一起去溪邊嗎？",
                "sound": "text/sound/65814/919653",
                "image": "boy-1.png",
                "background": "1-1.png"
            },
            {
                "text": "nakuni, makasi mungukocuvana!",
                "textCh": "可以，但你們要小心喔！",
                "sound": "text/sound/65814/919654",
                "image": "mom.png",
                "background": "1-3.png"
            },
            {
                "text": "iyo, nusauringo ma knamɨ!",
                "textCh": "沒問題，我們一定會注意的！",
                "sound": "text/sound/65814/919655",
                "image": "boy-1.png",
                "background": "1-1.png"
            }
        ],
        "phase2": {
            "player": [
                {
                    "text": "nuslapasu",
                    "textAb": "nuslapasu?",
                    "textCh": "你要找什麼？",
                    "sound": "text/sound/65815/919659",
                    "code": "1",
                    "score": 100
                },
                {
                    "text": "nunvétharamdɨ gia mua rɨna",
                    "textAb": "nunvétharamdɨ gia mua rɨna?",
                    "textCh": "溪邊要往哪裡走？",
                    "sound": "text/sound/65816/919672",
                    "code": "2",
                    "score": 100
                },
                {
                    "text": "duru ma musu ksédme kwa saldru la",
                    "textAb": "duru ma musu ksédme kwa saldru la?",
                    "textCh": "你可以借我刀子嗎？",
                    "sound": "text/sound/65817/919680",
                    "code": "3",
                    "score": 100
                }
            ],
            "target-1": {
                "0": {
                    "text": "acidri?",
                    "textCh": "什麼？",
                    "sound": "text/sound/65813/919646"
                },
                "1": {
                    "text": "nua ma kɨkɨ silpe rngele si akamanɨ butulu.",
                    "textCh": "我去找木炭和烤肉網。",
                    "sound": "text/sound/65815/919660"
                },
                "2": {
                    "text": "kdroo, iké dria tradronga na alapi.",
                    "textCh": "那邊，有顆大石頭那邊。",
                    "sound": "text/sound/65816/919673"
                },
                "3": {
                    "text": "nakuni, mra sarké.",
                    "textCh": "好啊，拿去使用！",
                    "sound": "text/sound/65817/919681"
                }
            },
            "target-2": {
                "0": {
                    "text": "ilrigu kwa masobkanɨsu?",
                    "textCh": "我聽不懂你說的話嗎？",
                    "sound": "text/sound/65813/919647"
                },
                "1": {
                    "text": "nua ma kɨkɨ silpe lpané si burathi.",
                    "textCh": "我去找玉米和地瓜。",
                    "sound": "text/sound/65815/919661"
                },
                "2": {
                    "text": "ilrigu kwa tékadra rɨna.",
                    "textCh": "我不知道溪邊在哪裡。",
                    "sound": "text/sound/65816/919674"
                },
                "3": {
                    "text": "tédra kwaa!",
                    "textCh": "我也沒有。",
                    "sound": "text/sound/65817/919682"
                }
            },
            "target-3": {
                "0": {
                    "text": "ilrigu kwa!",
                    "textCh": "我不知道！",
                    "sound": "text/sound/65813/919648"
                },
                "2": {
                    "text": "kani, silikila kɨkɨ dria siviri.",
                    "textCh": "這邊，我剛從溪邊回來。",
                    "sound": "text/sound/65816/919675"
                },
                "3": {
                    "text": "éni, mavsarɨnga saldru li.",
                    "textCh": "不行，我的刀子壞掉了。",
                    "sound": "text/sound/65817/919683"
                }
            },
            "stage": [
                {
                    "quest": "公車快要來了，但你們還沒買食材和工具。",
                    "tips": "問問看其他人「你要找什麼？」，<br>找出你要負責買的東西，放進購物籃吧！",
